              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 15:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu busingye bwa Ahazi mwene Yosamu, mutabani wa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda, Rezini omugabe wa Siria na Peeka mwene Remalia omugabe wa Israeli, bakainamuka Yerusaalemu kugirwanisa, kwonka tibaagibaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.8.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 8:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ab'enju ya Daudi ku baagambiirwe ngu Abasiria bakwataniise na Abaefuraimu, omutima gwa Ahazi n'emitima y'abantu be yaatetema nk'emiti y'omu kibira erikutengyetsibwa omuyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.36.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 36:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.18.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 18:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Isaaya ati: shohora hati, ogyende na mutabani waawe Sheari-yashubu, obugane Ahazi aha muheru gw'omukura gw'ekiyanja kya ruguru, ekiri aha muhanda ogurikuza aha musiri gw'omwozi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haza omugire oti: Oyerinde, ohitsye omutima omunda, orekye kutiina, kandi otahahaazibwa ekiniga kingi kya Rezini n'Abasiria, n'ekya mwene Remailia; bari nk'ebicumurwa bibiri by'enkanza zirikucumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noomanya ku Abaisria n'Abaefuraimu na mwene Remalia bakugiriire enaama mbi nibagira bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwije twinamukye tuteere Yuda, tubatiinise, tubeekubuurire, twemekye mwene Tabeeli, abe omugabe waayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.8.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 8:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Mukama RUHANGA agizire ati: Enaama yaabo terikwija kuhama, kandi terihikiirira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'okuba omutwe gwa Siria ni Damasiko, n'omutwe gwa Damasiko ni Rezini; kandi emyaka makumi mukaaga n'etaano etakahwireho, Abaefuraimu baryacuubwamu ebicweka, babae batakiba ihanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 20:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omutwe gwa Efuraimu ni Samaria, n'omutwe gwa Samaria ni mwene Remalia. Ku muraayangye kwikiriza, buzimazima timurihama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagaruka yaagira Ahazi ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akamanyiso, oshabe akarikuhika Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza, nari akarikuhika ahaiguru owa Herebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Ahazi yaagira ati: Tindikwija kushaba, kandi tindikwija kugyeza MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaya yaagira ati: Imwe nju ya Daudi 'mwe, nimuhurire! Nimugira ngu n'ekintu kikye okurusya abantu, mukataho n'okurusya Ruhanga wangye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 9:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
