            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo Mukama wenak aribaheera akamanyiso. Reeba, omwishiki oshugaine aryagira enda, azaare omwana w'omwojo, amwete Emanueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo mwana, ku arimanya kwanga ekibi n'okwihamu ekirungi, aryatungwa amate g'amakamo n'obwoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.6.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 6:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba omwana ogwo ku ariba atakagizire bwengye bw'okwanga ekibi n'okwihamu ekirungi, ensi z'abo bagabe bombi, abu orikutiina, ziryaba ebifurukwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
